            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Talimatların sırası önemlidir, çünkü oyun bunları satır satır takip eder.</p><p>Önce <code>step1</code>'i, ikinci olarak <code>step2</code>'yi ve üçüncü olarak <code>step3</code>'ü oluştur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start game loop&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Win level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const step1 = \"Spawn player\";</code>, ardından <code>const step2 = \"Start game loop\";</code> ve son olarak <code>const step3 = \"Win level\";</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
